# Getting in and out of the crew van (game/vehicles.ts, docs/mechanics/driving.md). F (the interact
# action, the sim's use button when no talk prompt is up) gets in and out; E stays step off. By the
# parked van but 2.2 m off its side (vehicles.enter is 2 m), F does nothing: nothing in reach. E steps
# off the board there as anywhere. Half a metre closer on foot, F gets in (no board drop). Driving off at
# 4.5 m/s, F does nothing but say why (vehicleExitBlocked, moving: out only below vehicles.exit.speed).
# Stopped, F puts the skater out on the board beside the driver's door (the van's left); E there steps
# off the board, and F on foot gets straight back in.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 57.5 -12.4 -1.25 180
tap use 20
tap walk 40
hold up 60..95
tap use 140
hold right 150..230
hold up 150..330
tap use 300
hold down 330..420
tap use 520
tap walk 560
tap use 600
run 700
expect no event vehicleEnter within 0..139
expect no event stepOff within 0..39
expect event stepOff within 40..42
expect event vehicleEnter{name=crew_van} within 140..142
expect no event boardDrop within 0..519
expect state drive at 200
expect event vehicleExitBlocked{reason=moving} within 300..302
expect van.hspeed > 4 at 301
expect state drive at 400
expect event vehicleExit{name=crew_van} within 520..522
expect state ground at 530
expect van.gap > 1.5 at 530
expect van.gap < 2 at 530
expect event stepOff within 560..562
expect state walk at 580
expect event vehicleEnter count == 2
expect state drive at end
expect no event bail
